-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DCC model train captures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Captures of a ZIMO MX10 command station.


Logic analyzer setup
--------------------

The logic analyzer used was a nanoDLA (samplerate 1MHz).

  Probe       DCC
  ------------------
  0           P track
  1           N track


Captures
--------

  Capture                                     Action
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  operations_mode_to_service_mode_and_back.sr Seamless transition from operations mode to service mode and back
  operations_mode_with_cutout.sr              Operations mode with lots of different decoders in the transmission cycle (RailCom enabled)
  operations_mode_without_cutout.sr           Operations mode with lots of different decoders in the transmission cycle (RailCom disabled)